    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Elihu kūbawīla banwani ba ng'wa Ayubu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 32:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū a banhū būdatū wabo benabo, boya ū kūnshokeja ū Ayubu; nguno ū mu maganiko gakwe wibonaga gīkī walī ntūngīlīja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.32.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.32.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 32:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alilūūlū, walīho Elihu ng'wana Balakeli, muna Buzi wa mu lūganda lwa Lamu; ū munhū ng'wenūyo akapelana no, ūmpelanīla ū Ayubu, nguno wihayaga gīkī ū wei hū walī ntūngīlīja, at'ū Mulungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.32.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.32.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 32:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na a banwani biye ba ng'wa Ayubu, a badatū akabapelanīla, nguno bakagayiwa ū mhayo gwa kūnshokeja ū Ayubu, nūūlū īkī bamonaga gīkī walī ng'hūbi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.32.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.32.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 32:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū wei ū Elihu walī wahuumūla, ūbaleka tame a boi būlūngalūnga nū Ayubu, nguno baalī banamhala kūntinda ū we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.32.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.32.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 32:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo aho wabona gīkī ū mu būdatū wabo yabagaya ī ya kongeja kūshosha, akasaaya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.32.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.32.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
